 CellLabel->"Out[1]= ",ExpressionUUID->"780a6b26-25ab-477a-9dbc-8c4ba5ac9942"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
The proper-time scale over the velocity for three light angles: it is 1 at \
rest and falls to 0 at the speed of light.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"53ba883e-5e89-4ec3-ab0e-31d226a7cf61"],

